name: ['Beseech the Queen', 'Cabal Ritual', 'Conflux', 'Dark Depths', 'Glissa, the Traitor', 'Helvault', 'Memnarch', "Mind's Desire", 'Momir Vig, Simic Visionary', 'Near-Death Experience', 'Obliterate', 'Phyrexian Processor', 'Tolaria West', "Umezawa's Jitte", 'Unmask']
